      "primary_text": "Want guidance while installing a childproofing kit? The Peach Bucket 6-in-1 Child Safety Kit includes 1-to-1 installation video support, so you can get help with its parts. It’s listed at ₹3,299, with ₹299 savings on prepaid orders. Adult supervision is still necessary. See the kit and its support details.",
